<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Thai May C/A deficit 22.8 bln baht.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Thai May C/A deficit 22.8 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's May current account deficit narrowed to a preliminary 22.8 billion baht from a 38.0 billion baht deficit in April, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	    May 97    April 97	May 96</p>
<p>				  22.8	  38.0	   35.8</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 6520642</p>
</text>
